ree separate words run together by mistake.",0],["It is too long to be a real word.",0],["Ich gehe zu Berlin.",0]]},{"q": "Which of these is the best definition of “Weiss”?","options": [["Yellow.",0],["Blue.",0],["Red.",0],["White.",1]]},{"q": "Which of these is the best definition of “Schwarz”?","options": [["Blue.",0],["Black.",1],["White.",0],["Red.",0]]},{"q": "Which of these is the best definition of “Blau”?","options": [["White.",0],["Black.",0],["Blue.",1],["Yellow.",0]]},{"q": "Which of these is the best definition of “Grun”?","options": [["Red.",0],["Black.",0],["White.",0],["Green.",1]]},{"q": "Which of these is the best definition of “Gelb”?","options": [["Yellow.",1],["Blue.",0],["Black.",0],["Green.",0]]},{"q": "Which of these is the best definition of “Rot”?","options": [["Blue.",0],["Yellow.",0],["Black.",0],["Red.",1]]},{"q": "How many basic colours are listed (concepts)?","options": [["5",0],["6",1],["4",0],["3",0]]}],"numericals": [{"q": "How many basic colours are listed (concepts)?","options": [3,4,5,6],"answer": 6}],"free_texts": [{"q": "What is German for red? (lowercase ASCII)","answer": "rot"}],"mcqs_expanded": true,"sequence": [{"term": "Violett","def": "Kürzeste Wellenlänge: etwa 400 Nanometer"},{"term": "Blau","def": "Etwa 470 Nanometer"},{"term": "Grün","def": "Etwa 530 Nanometer"},{"term": "Gelb","def": "Etwa 580 Nanometer"},{"term": "Orange","def": "Etwa 610 Nanometer"},{"term": "Rot","def": "Längste Wellenlänge: etwa 700 Nanometer"}],"reviewStatus": "unreviewed","specTopicMatch": false,"specNote": "No E-Evaluate quiz exists for this subject/level/topic, so this bank's spec alignment is unverified."}